# Agent skills installed via `npx skills`.
#
# Project-scope (chezmoi repo's own .agents/skills/ + .claude/skills/ + skills-lock.json):
#   These exist purely so the chezmoi repo itself can use project-scope skills
#   while you edit it.  They MUST NOT deploy — global install at ~/.agents/skills/
#   already covers every machine.  Auto-restored on `chezmoi apply` by
#   .chezmoiscripts/repo/run_onchange_after_45_bootstrap_skills.sh.tmpl when source dir == repo;
#   manual fallback: `just bootstrap-skills` (or `npx skills experimental_install`).
#
# Global-scope (~/.agents/.skill-lock.json + ~/.agents/skills/):
#   The lock file IS chezmoi-managed via dot_agents/modify_dot_skill-lock.json.tmpl
#   (merger script, see docs/tools/agent-skills.md).  The skills/ folder under
#   it is owned by the npx skills CLI and re-populated by
#   run_onchange_after_install_global_skills.sh.tmpl whenever the lock changes,
#   so we do NOT want chezmoi to manage skills/ contents directly. Herdr is the
#   one direct-managed exception: run_after_42_sync_herdr_skill.sh.tmpl writes
#   its binary-matched SKILL.md, while chezmoi only owns Claude's symlink to it.
#
# Patterns use single-`*` (direct child) + `*/**` (its contents) form instead of a
# bare `**`. This is load-bearing: a recursive `**` (or a bare `.agents/skills`
# dir line) excludes the PARENT dir, and chezmoi — like gitignore — then refuses to
# re-include anything beneath it (the `!` negations below silently no-op). The
# `*` form leaves `.agents/skills` itself un-excluded so the one first-party skill
# can be re-included. Coverage for npx skills is unchanged (they're `name/...`,
# all matched by `*` + `*/**`).
.agents/skills/*
.agents/skills/*/**
.claude/skills/*
.claude/skills/*/**
skills-lock.json

# Exceptions: re-include the first-party templated skill and Claude discovery
# symlinks for direct-managed skills past the npx ignore above (last match wins).
# `chezmoi-dotfiles` renders per-host; Herdr's real SKILL.md remains ignored and
# is emitted by the installed binary, while only its .claude/ symlink is managed.
# See docs/tools/agent-skills.md.
!.agents/skills/chezmoi-dotfiles
!.agents/skills/chezmoi-dotfiles/**
!.claude/skills/chezmoi-dotfiles
!.claude/skills/herdr

scripts/**

